			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Flatten ExtensionRegistry module structure\n\nRemove extensive header documentation and flatten the `ExtensionRegistry` module hierarchy in `ApplicationState`. Replace the previous dual-module pattern (`mod.rs` re-exporting `ExtensionRegistry.rs`) with a single canonical path where the struct resides in `ExtensionRegistry/ExtensionRegistry.rs`.\n\nThis aligns with the ongoing decomposition of `ExtensionState` into file-per-struct PascalCase modules, ensuring consistent symbol resolution for the `Registration` DTO used by the gRPC `Vine` protocol handlers.",
			"SHA": "14fbb1ec3e3dc570a85c092b36ca68de79ade894"
		},
